Day 2

Configure storage (local in dev, S3/MinIO ready in prod).

Day 3

Endpoint:

Upload attachment to a task.

List attachments per task.

Day 4

Add size and type validation.

Day 5

Webhook endpoints for external integrations (e.g., /webhooks/github/issue/ stub).

Day 6

Store external IDs & references (e.g., GitHub issue id on Task).

Day 7

Tests for file handling and simple integration stubs.

